  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "U06Sa7eHdjvV779C7aVZgnFqp1U=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:12.836Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Every metric uses the meter name `@powerhousedao/reactor`, and units follow OpenTelemetry semantic conventions in UCUM \u2014 curly-brace annotations like `{job}`, `{operation}`, `{event}` and `{remote}` are dimensionless counts, `ms` is a duration.\n\nThe families:\n\n- **Queue** \u2014 `reactor.queue.jobs.enqueued` / `.dequeued` / `.completed` (READ_READY) / `.failed` (permanently) as counters, plus observable gauges `reactor.queue.depth` (pending jobs across all queues) and `reactor.queue.executing`.\n- **Executor** \u2014 `reactor.executor.job.duration` (histogram, ms, RUNNING \u2192 WRITE_READY, attribute `job.success`), `reactor.executor.active_jobs`, `reactor.executor.total_processed` (attribute `job.success`), `reactor.executor.operations_generated`.\n- **Read model** \u2014 `reactor.readmodel.index.duration` (histogram, WRITE_READY \u2192 READ_READY).\n- **Event bus** \u2014 `reactor.eventbus.events.emitted` with an `event.type` attribute.\n- **Sync** \u2014 `reactor.sync.remotes` (active remote count) and `reactor.sync.dead_letters.added` with a `remote.name` attribute.\n\nWhat makes the taxonomy genuinely useful is the event-mapping table: each metric is recorded from a named event, so a gap in a metric is a gap in an event.\n\n| Event | Code | Records |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `JOB_PENDING` | 10001 | `queue.jobs.enqueued` |\n| `JOB_RUNNING` | 10002 | `queue.jobs.dequeued` |\n| `JOB_WRITE_READY` | 10003 | `executor.job.duration`, `total_processed`, `operations_generated` |\n| `JOB_READ_READY` | 10004 | `readmodel.index.duration`, `job.total.duration`, `queue.jobs.completed` |\n| `JOB_FAILED` | 10005 | `queue.jobs.failed`, `total_processed`, `job.total.duration` |\n| `DEAD_LETTER_ADDED` | 20004 | `sync.dead_letters.added` |\n\nEvery one of them also increments `eventbus.events.emitted`.\n\n## Provenance\n- `packages/opentelemetry-instrumentation-reactor/docs/taxonomy.md` \u2014 Units; Queue; Executor; Job Lifecycle; Event Bus; Sync; Event Types Tracked\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:43:12.836Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:12.836Z"
    }
  },
